[
  {"id": 0, "src_sha256": "014fda825784090f5e76912f75967836b5be1a5287455bf901050bef33600aa0", "zh": "想幹嘛？只要是會走的，我都能把它改一改。 "},
  {"id": 1, "src_sha256": "2ceb3aa8b0e82159b79820324c3a4cedf88cf8718dfd0340ce83b5cfc2f5ae6b", "zh": "很好，我的傷害要更高了！ "},
  {"id": 2, "src_sha256": "4e47b2c35df055b41af0050b11a0e04bcabbd93be6802219af6f3f0e25eaa75a", "zh": "喔喔，我看到好多血…… "},
  {"id": 3, "src_sha256": "503b525d008b5952baa592ac75a73d4ed673875e45bba1d29dd916bec04d709b", "zh": "我的身體零件要擺哪兒啊？ "},
  {"id": 4, "src_sha256": "42b4e9b11fffc238aa216e65de36298f9d821915e77ab91946523c663c123a9e", "zh": "睡覺。我需要。現在。 "},
  {"id": 5, "src_sha256": "1f9aefbddee6c4dcacf9eefebeccfd58db038c4fc88d11f4df0ef3501f45e2c0", "zh": "我肚子裡在燒。 "},
  {"id": 6, "src_sha256": "d958830418e9cab9f97b5136c4499b6e0caac76e47e4b1959eba02386cd438ab", "zh": "染上不好的東西了。 "},
  {"id": 7, "src_sha256": "aca6d212e2fcea9ee7eb1d2e8402ffbc033e6d2fc9c5f3e4f66c808bdb2697e3", "zh": "我看不到我在幹嘛。 "},
  {"id": 8, "src_sha256": "bc9c2a58267340b2f8e2f92964413cf8e08778b7704eba9d2a0e2de173564a8b", "zh": "太重的話，我就開始賣掉它，好不好？ "},
  {"id": 9, "src_sha256": "812c439c897f92b1d3745ef8b6737cbb8f49d37a13f2c3d347d22c366a2f1ca9", "zh": "動不了！現在怎麼辦？用眨眼把人眨死嗎？！？ "},
  {"id": 10, "src_sha256": "b8168f2cd472fea55e2aecb5ee4a6ae55aada777d88100d02d551c90c96b2cbf", "zh": "我正要這麼說的。 "},
  {"id": 11, "src_sha256": "ec2e32bf5c520a4f8b34b69716c2cae4234f754fc2fbe04ba87cf2b47bce6b1a", "zh": "那真是糟透了。再來一次吧。 "},
  {"id": 12, "src_sha256": "7780258b6f71d1604374bdf4984438817c12d1d95bc936ee06fe820742039b7c", "zh": "還有你所有死掉的親戚向你大聲問好！ "},
  {"id": 13, "src_sha256": "c998c1b165f27ddbb7726b23a330653427676d63b10ea09116f4dcd6600de5c8", "zh": "我們陷得很深了。依我看，唯一的希望就是把證據吃掉。 "},
  {"id": 14, "src_sha256": "d6d702d92264cc4c7d6c4505a25d0b068099be2008e5fd5f2244c3ae986b5aa5", "zh": "所以……要打嗎？ "},
  {"id": 15, "src_sha256": "7c8920622933a5e0a804ca37d1ed62402227785169cb9d94fb5bdaab70da470b", "zh": "我最討厭杵在這兒。快走吧，不然我要開始抖、抖、抖起來了。 "},
  {"id": 16, "src_sha256": "e658bc6b9dbe03fedd922dca50d4c10a84b73a378d67939b69c64a526776d95c", "zh": "嘿，別擋我的路！ "},
  {"id": 17, "src_sha256": "f6168790cf8e64e487a4afab62e42d292f68fdded7edadae5dccc1d4dc847148", "zh": "那是我見過最弱的東西。 "},
  {"id": 18, "src_sha256": "e9f67c8735c4457c522a00ef95f93bbaa842d572ceda2da1f83e86eb9b3357f7", "zh": "他的東西我先預訂了。 "},
  {"id": 19, "src_sha256": "8497281b98dacbd2f03139c27cff798233d2147eedfe3ec04fb603ee1f7a49bf", "zh": "她是聖人！聖人啊！ "},
  {"id": 20, "src_sha256": "3bbca4fa3b197f181f1f733721f6e8787cf541ebf5f9ac0c206fd9dca37172aa", "zh": "又掛一個啊？嘿，這個器官挺有意思的。 "},
  {"id": 21, "src_sha256": "d75250ad9bf9aff397a0f05b7801a596c62b00a3434a57a20e21d393dfced424", "zh": "更多的混亂歸我！ "},
  {"id": 22, "src_sha256": "8db0c37ef7e609ed551bd8e5dce99ba8c1585779b65ef0b09cad913587b4010b", "zh": "歡迎來到世界末日！哈哈哈哈！ "},
  {"id": 23, "src_sha256": "e3bc69eea9447421fdbded4b37813e7143052409231e6bef41035f179d4f8b50", "zh": "來看看這個。 "},
  {"id": 24, "src_sha256": "07ed46869cff3e6e7f4d3dbe568564784878316a9a2badaa8c3213f01c7994ba", "zh": "撿到就是我的。 "},
  {"id": 25, "src_sha256": "851891161ceef97277af174062a0d01fd56c6b035e6dccf3c3af9ff046c5cf66", "zh": "啊，陷阱。如果我把這玩意兒這樣一拉，不知道會怎樣…… "},
  {"id": 26, "src_sha256": "2854cb86aa0d37ce6fe763b0cd51fc51aec044179b6c46b507c136523352e94e", "zh": "好啦，這下不再是祕密了。 "},
  {"id": 27, "src_sha256": "b96a942cf5c6a507a375ba8366de9c9527b48eefc6ea3d126d04e8e16f385378", "zh": "危險。我愛死了。 "},
  {"id": 28, "src_sha256": "664718b1389f8a98eefcdd98eda0d26b16f31d401ceb6e030b88ddf6d191d0bb", "zh": "他們把我當肉塊在切啊！ "},
  {"id": 29, "src_sha256": "fc802aae3ba791de21ee6886e22b654e016236f123e2e662fe95c32b92aa6feb", "zh": "哈，這會是一場派對！ "},
  {"id": 30, "src_sha256": "57d98539c6d51f37a19e4f5995aba806314a90401c33c1aa978912c9ad991bfe", "zh": "新鮮的肉！上，抓住他們！ "},
  {"id": 31, "src_sha256": "8cdbf9d76626f23b69ca05146bb493b7a991de79f2a0f90c0b6701ae24070f58", "zh": "我聞到……血！好多血！ "},
  {"id": 32, "src_sha256": "64bbbaaa91705d93fe0af9fccef89552a46f474d12e4ebbe8d30224fe135fcf7", "zh": "下一個幸運目標是誰？ "},
  {"id": 33, "src_sha256": "fa48bb23b47f47d04da258302c615e82911af2104c6df9224c1dabaf1cc00e1d", "zh": "啊哈哈！ "},
  {"id": 34, "src_sha256": "27603b9d1ffd87ca0ef7c2497aba940cef8eee2f21e516793bddcda720075f4f", "zh": "好險！ "},
  {"id": 35, "src_sha256": "2216f8d24c0392988fa9809c9cdcf73c48304c0550d81fcbc47ddf3e48c9117a", "zh": "啊啊啊啊！ "},
  {"id": 36, "src_sha256": "639d2a85b207e488fea10147446d130cff336b836820f3aec2918b1111d30ca8", "zh": "你那些病態又扭曲的計畫差點就成功了，Savant……要不是遇上我。啊哈哈哈！ "},
  {"id": 37, "src_sha256": "8c854b9d4392604e8090669c278ffcdc48d6a42d4661ba5a0577bf24d65b1e4b", "zh": "這才是我喜歡的樣子。死透了！ "},
  {"id": 38, "src_sha256": "2cc16927bd8e52eb8cdc0d972deb265700f2e3a8b6af67a24cc2b11786a74dff", "zh": "瞧瞧是誰晃進來了。 "},
  {"id": 39, "src_sha256": "5781297277930de997e1bbc69201a69575cc617bce9d15336029759540e48e39", "zh": "我在對空氣開槍！ "},
  {"id": 40, "src_sha256": "e37d0a7566a67051b0672476354d99c46ea9aa5de58ff05a0e40ac1dce999400", "zh": "有哪裡不一樣了，可我說不上來。嗯…… "},
  {"id": 41, "src_sha256": "c67e00172ddb15dacca9dbf56c086c35640fd11fb5ad43bd061d7e7a975f13d9", "zh": "嗯，好地方。等我們解決了 Dark Savant 這傢伙，就把它拆了。 "},
  {"id": 42, "src_sha256": "c66ee2cf123d779424146da88f05e3d9b00fff46fe36f8477b92a0652d4311c2", "zh": "你知道嗎，我說我有一天要接管宇宙的時候，他們都說我瘋了。啊哈哈哈哈！ "},
  {"id": 43, "src_sha256": "7baadea6c846d9366f086213071b477e3e7d148e57a3daecab00dbbc55f1fdc3", "zh": "她很兇，但我喜歡！ "},
  {"id": 44, "src_sha256": "73c9ea4322f764575fef7780ba14418492029bcb133da1bee4224ec046895eac", "zh": "啊啊啊！住手！滾出去！我不要回去那裡！我說過做完那件事我就走了！你不能……逼……我……留下！噢！好啦，夠了，Al-Sedexus！我回來跟你算帳。來吧各位，我們把這事了結 "},
  {"id": 45, "src_sha256": "8646e13993db9c6a958b2b58a741ade7dbf6918670b14585af7ada692b55f3b8", "zh": "好啦，那個 Rapax 的東西就在這附近某處。來吧 Al-Sedexus！我給你準備了一份大禮！ "},
  {"id": 46, "src_sha256": "6742e483354548a7f6952f21370dc4da1e920951c9898e5208980c8fa3f96bee", "zh": "老黑臉脾氣差的那位，聽到我們拿到 Astral Domintrix 還是什麼的，不氣炸才怪。 "},
  {"id": 47, "src_sha256": "d50e1a1f100c08915b481c9dfd0cc6d6fdcb23958d40ff31e8eed66438e155eb", "zh": "所以 Marten 是知道太多才發瘋的，是吧？這我懂。 "},
  {"id": 48, "src_sha256": "52473ee9214eb19d995e4d86867e78ade3a71e4f898cabc01702d491c33f3fa0", "zh": "我真是太滑溜了。{{Mook}} 居然完全沒發現！可惜得拿去 Ascension Peak。我還想多玩一會兒呢。 "},
  {"id": 49, "src_sha256": "51c0e052c91a52bc20b48bb09ae3e7a2da7267ffb69f14bc4f9ae9aeef45406c", "zh": "Chaos！是我的，是我的，是我的！去 Ascension Peak 之前先玩一下嘛。拜託？ "},
  {"id": 50, "src_sha256": "969868ce09c23ce1d9a7d33eaf40831dfb59f051c872824e34524976f806477b", "zh": "不然你以為呢？你以為 Savant 會乖乖坐著放鬆嗎？ "},
  {"id": 51, "src_sha256": "f2baa1e39459d43fe7be2dcb0d5b248a5e16e6053352529d23a4aa2fcb5d1fc5", "zh": "你們先走，我留在這兒。別費心去猜，這是我非做不可的事。我會回來的。 "},
  {"id": 52, "src_sha256": "7fecd9861c6eeeb03724c7757c19a40549e13666cd2892604f8a7f46a812811e", "zh": "告訴你，我在裡面找到我的天職了！{{Mook}} 擁有 Chaos 耶，老兄，他們自己還不知道！ "},
  {"id": 53, "src_sha256": "b98e3466b23c99f2b6c1fd56b172c003b2e7ddde9779e9440200adac175ff5c9", "zh": "你瘋了嗎？ "},
  {"id": 54, "src_sha256": "70b88619739a4959258c4294b107e535945ab6f54a30290fc3019036913e9f30", "zh": "有人說謊我一看就知道。我會有股壓不住的衝動想掐死他們。 "},
  {"id": 55, "src_sha256": "0d7a13b2e12deb06eab0d79b710ccceb6e91ba0528e2da7e949549f1f78f849f", "zh": "誰敢來搶這個，我就拔光他的牙。 "},
  {"id": 56, "src_sha256": "07172f46d4a4ca8eb5b7a17c6a0c240eee447c6f5de0aad1483fd2859373d912", "zh": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊。 "},
  {"id": 57, "src_sha256": "0ff6f5d93d02a72e0185437d8885419ad4022e6fb72608d2bf4dcf64c975bc52", "zh": "她來了。 "},
  {"id": 58, "src_sha256": "1f7588b8cdf428db6e6e47bc9ebed37c90db7c645795314a65904deadab16c8d", "zh": "看來我們把那些笨蛋甩掉了。 "},
  {"id": 59, "src_sha256": "ba7e23c25cff69afe7d49ab32716680572eca62186181c3aa3cf363d46347a24", "zh": "蠢 Rapax。他們早該跟我們組隊的。這下只好全部殺光了。 "},
  {"id": 60, "src_sha256": "9430fa8f6aa3cef3d199821fe117e746c50fd71c619a4a34b95dbfd862462a43", "zh": "那就是 Dark Savant 啊？真是個窩囊廢。我都準備好跟他打了。他幹嘛跑掉？給我回來！ "},
  {"id": 61, "src_sha256": "ee8b69bddfb402a4c06661b2c5dcebdaab44733631487192898b218019467757", "zh": "那個老陰森怎麼會對 Cosmic Lords 和他們的鍛造爐知道那麼多？我覺得可疑。 "},
  {"id": 62, "src_sha256": "3ab0a8062299e11ce76b26b802c824430ba75a31d379210cfba19c6dcc53923e", "zh": "喔呵呵……我們把它裝回去，這樣就能再炸一次了！耶！ "},
  {"id": 63, "src_sha256": "3b2afbda24addcd620ea0b87f655a2f95dec3b2308e652119f0b5bf1bc2fda89", "zh": "大家好像都為這個和平的事很開心。我就是搞不懂。 "},
  {"id": 64, "src_sha256": "3a25d5b5f38101e0e249d39684a36bb976a2ea7231b58dc6bcda29233adfb67a", "zh": "他們死了。你們不要的話，我就收下。 "},
  {"id": 65, "src_sha256": "68ebd6d66b7c1108891bbf9be2476573f2bd9254f5c8ab15f51806d98e77c9f0", "zh": "又記上一件任務。 "},
  {"id": 66, "src_sha256": "188a3d79bf0758d714f52aab00f5bec39b7b83f60741461563fd5281287ebb78", "zh": "這根本就……弱爆了。他怎麼可能把真正的 Astral Dominae 隨便丟著。來啊，Savant，你可以做得更好的！ "},
  {"id": 67, "src_sha256": "d0a3268e787fb0dd900e7e90d016098ba694a912fec783acec591eba12ab37cf", "zh": "來客人啦！ "},
  {"id": 68, "src_sha256": "630d821110217f0ba48f848fbc96895751bf6101bf4b485971f33a1b73e29b4a", "zh": "我看到你啦！ "},
  {"id": 84, "src_sha256": "6db9a490493ae067051dd8798f3406fe9e69d45f68d08ef9c12860af4c99d515", "zh": "還不賴。 "},
  {"id": 85, "src_sha256": "0a12794de216e01f8abbdd9f04e9cf2ee4bdb30f569abbdde474014b0051a8ee", "zh": "我幾乎覺得正常了。 "},
  {"id": 121, "src_sha256": "fe17ef2f1de40457ee216bb163cbce54a2fc2464520550f8e1da2b938daae644", "zh": "隨你怎麼說，這個 Z'Ant 傢伙還不錯！ "},
  {"id": 123, "src_sha256": "db8cbeaa134195b762b98d9d02e1a8402d0cd8c5444ac7f45d499b2fce065079", "zh": "你不得不佩服這傢伙。死了這點小事，一點都沒讓他慢下來！ "},
  {"id": 126, "src_sha256": "4a952115690b31d01925638566a7844d18af2ee5768481cb01edf88b05014ae1", "zh": "那些 Rapax 根本沒有他們吹的一半強。 "},
  {"id": 129, "src_sha256": "c063189d18dcc6009faa9de9aa4f4aaf83af0a3fa4551b92da06e31c6e9090c1", "zh": "來吧，我們走吧。我敢說這顆星球跟我們離開的那顆一樣爛。 "},
  {"id": 130, "src_sha256": "52ad36260baf6dd94f4a53c0ac97a462854ccd905cd30a912b9f6b6c39b36010", "zh": "咦，不知道這東西是幹嘛的？ "},
  {"id": 131, "src_sha256": "059657fdc4fbce8b70970cdf508fedbbcd4b39ec418cde96b030d1d9162cbcb4", "zh": "這才像話！那個女巫終於從我腦袋裡滾出去了。告訴你，她活該。 "},
  {"id": 132, "src_sha256": "d31dd18e00bf8af7b1097799529c07d493d8a159fc80bee71bb900484c808afd", "zh": "小事一樁。下一個是什麼？我們是要把這頂 Helm 交給那個 Marten 對吧？ "},
  {"id": 135, "src_sha256": "1cddb5e0376d4feb73a1b59c2343e134dacb0d4bf0c63c4427525cd440a28e37", "zh": "慢點，各位。那邊還有一個 Savant 的{{Android}}。這個沒在動，不過說不定只是在裝死。 "},
  {"id": 140, "src_sha256": "3541963efe20650e5d5c7fa85089f869ff1b096347b05be2e500fe753e128946", "zh": "你看看那個！他們一定是用那玩意兒從太空船把更多 T'Rang 送下來。 "},
  {"id": 142, "src_sha256": "9804e0b262336553e218b849a6da7908ba629892052c5d201cead7bd788ad545", "zh": "Umpani 一定是保全過度了。外面的營地還不夠，還得蓋個地下堡壘！ "},
  {"id": 144, "src_sha256": "c73f1ddd596ec4bc153d3d56af44417e20123a5a4cc3a4f6977f3b8df7ccdfa8", "zh": "這一定就是那些 Rattkin 混的地方。老實說我還挺期待見他們的。聽說他們是一群很精明的傢伙。 "}
]
